### Matrix
| bounds |{a,b,c}|{j,h}|{a,b,c,d,f}|{b,d,g}|
|-|-------|-----|-----------|-------|
|lower bounds| a | a,b,c,d,f | a | a,b|
|upper bounds| e,f,h,j | none | f,j,h | g,h |
|greatest lower bounds| a | f | a | b |
|least upper bounds| e | none | f | g |


**Lattice**
A Poset in which any two distinct elements have a greatest lower bound & a least upper bounds